<title>ITALY: Bank Italy sets 9.0 trln lire reverse repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank Italy sets 9.0 trln lire reverse repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 9.0 trillion lire reverse repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on October 25.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 10.0 trillion lire on October 7, the average accepted rate stood at 8.54 percent and the maximum rate at 8.59 percent.</p>
